{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:30:37+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nanoplanet Survivors", "steam_appid": 2287420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287420/extras/ef71ade56a1f6a05f6cba16eeaf8910a.poster.avif?t=1792700183\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287420/extras/ef71ade56a1f6a05f6cba16eeaf8910a.webm?t=1792700183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>&quot;Nanoplanet Survivors: A Relentless Battle for Existence&quot;<br><br>In &quot;Nanoplanet Survivors,&quot; players are thrust into an unyielding bullet hell odyssey on a hostile exoplanet overrun with alien menaces. Each encounter is a test of survival, demanding quick reflexes and strategic use of character upgrades and abilities.<br><br>This game is a symphony of survival and strategy, where no two experiences are alike. Players confront a myriad of alien foes – from towering extraterrestrial behemoths to relentless hordes – all while the intensity of battle escalates with each wave.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in an immersive bullet hell survival experience, demanding skill and strategic adaptation.<br></li><li>Encounter an ever-evolving roster of alien adversaries, with each wave presenting increasingly formidable challenges.<br></li><li>Utilize a diverse array of character abilities and ultimate powers for tactical advantage.<br></li><li>Acquire and leverage powerful upgrades, customizing your approach to each unique playthrough.<br></li><li>Face epic showdowns against colossal world bosses, testing the limits of your survival skills.<br></li><li>Challenge a variety of wave bosses, each presenting unique patterns and tactics to overcome.<br></li><li>Unlock a diverse range of characters, pets, and abilities, adding depth and variety to gameplay.<br></li><li>Experience a dynamic game environment, where adaptability is key to enduring the relentless onslaught.<br></li><li>Achieve meta-progression with unlockables that enhance your capabilities in subsequent runs.<br></li><li>Earn challenging achievements that highlight your journey and prowess on the nanoplanet.</li></ul>In &quot;Nanoplanet Survivors,&quot; the fate of humanity hangs in the balance. As the ultimate survivor, are you prepared to face the relentless dangers of this nanoplanet?", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287420/extras/ef71ade56a1f6a05f6cba16eeaf8910a.poster.avif?t=1792700183\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287420/extras/ef71ade56a1f6a05f6cba16eeaf8910a.webm?t=1792700183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>&quot;Nanoplanet Survivors: A Relentless Battle for Existence&quot;<br><br>In &quot;Nanoplanet Survivors,&quot; players are thrust into an unyielding bullet hell odyssey on a hostile exoplanet overrun with alien menaces. Each encounter is a test of survival, demanding quick reflexes and strategic use of character upgrades and abilities.<br><br>This game is a symphony of survival and strategy, where no two experiences are alike. Players confront a myriad of alien foes – from towering extraterrestrial behemoths to relentless hordes – all while the intensity of battle escalates with each wave.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in an immersive bullet hell survival experience, demanding skill and strategic adaptation.<br></li><li>Encounter an ever-evolving roster of alien adversaries, with each wave presenting increasingly formidable challenges.<br></li><li>Utilize a diverse array of character abilities and ultimate powers for tactical advantage.<br></li><li>Acquire and leverage powerful upgrades, customizing your approach to each unique playthrough.<br></li><li>Face epic showdowns against colossal world bosses, testing the limits of your survival skills.<br></li><li>Challenge a variety of wave bosses, each presenting unique patterns and tactics to overcome.<br></li><li>Unlock a diverse range of characters, pets, and abilities, adding depth and variety to gameplay.<br></li><li>Experience a dynamic game environment, where adaptability is key to enduring the relentless onslaught.<br></li><li>Achieve meta-progression with unlockables that enhance your capabilities in subsequent runs.<br></li><li>Earn challenging achievements that highlight your journey and prowess on the nanoplanet.</li></ul>In &quot;Nanoplanet Survivors,&quot; the fate of humanity hangs in the balance. As the ultimate survivor, are you prepared to face the relentless dangers of this nanoplanet?", "short_description": "Nanoplanet Survivors is a heart-pounding bullet hell survival game set on a hostile planet. Battle relentless waves of alien foes and adapt with powerful upgrades and unique character abilities. Epic boss fights make every playthrough a thrilling challenge. Can you emerge as the ultimate survivor?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287420/header.jpg?t=1792700183", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287420/9aaae9753ed1ab058eb1d63e5978a8402d1aa